             modifies explicitly specified slices, unless --ii is also given, in
             which case all existing slices are deleted (marked as “unused”)
             before the _c_o_n_f_i_g_f_i_l_e is read.  The _c_o_n_f_i_g_f_i_l_e can be ‘--’, in
